Tips: {
	T0: If you are struggling to overcome a challenge, maybe try doing something different. Don't bang your head against the wall!
	T1: There are all sorts of secrets and treasures to uncover in the world of Lunar Veil, you definitely won't find them all.
	T2: If you think you need a new piece of equipment, try brewing something up in the Magic Cauldron at Witch Town!
}
